# Claude Code Configuration

## Code Style
- Always adhere to RuboCop rules defined in .rubocop.yml
- Run rubocop checks before completing tasks
- Keep methods under 20 lines
- Keep classes under 100 lines
- Keep ABC size under 22
- Keep cyclomatic complexity under 7

## Rails Conventions
- Follow Rails naming conventions
- Use strong parameters in controllers
- Keep controllers thin, move logic to models/services
